# The Cloudflare token worker:deploy runs with, minted by
# `mise run mint:cloudflare --permissions mise-tasks/worker/deploy.permissions`.
# Uploading the Worker, its Durable Object migration and its custom domain
# (PUT /accounts/{account_id}/workers/domains) all take this one account
# permission; Cloudflare creates the domain's DNS record and certificate.
Workers Scripts Write (account)
